OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FEast
OL,6,Fremaining cloudy with further patchy
OL,7,Flight rain. West dry with clear
OL,8,Fspells, combining with light winds
OL,9,Fbringing frost and the risk of fog
OL,10,Fpatches, chiefly to rural parts.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FSettled, largely dry fare
OL,13,Fwith bright and sunny spells
OL,14,Fincreasing, but any early mist and fog
OL,15,Fin the west may be slow to burn back.
OL,16,FWinds light.
OL,17,
OL,18,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,19,FMainly cloudy with patchy light rain
OL,20,Ffocused across the east of the area.
OL,21,FWinds light to moderate easterly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
